{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#card-zh","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-allow 是适用于 DSH Web 的审批界面插件，在会话审批弹窗中增加“本次会话允许”操作。它接管 conversation.composer 审批面板，按会话和权限模式保存授权；同一会话再次请求已授权模式时自动答复允许一次，并展示可撤销的授权项。普通允许和拒绝操作仍可使用。适合希望减少重复确认、同时按会话管理授权的 Web 用户。授权记录保存在浏览器 localStorage，不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:242-373","lib/client.js:398-405"]}
{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#card-en","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-allow adds a session-allow action to the DSH Web approval panel. It stores grants by session and permission mode in localStorage, auto-answers matching requests, and lists grants for revocation. Reject and allow-once remain available.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:242-373","lib/client.js:398-405"]}
