{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#feature-1","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-allow 的功能「会话级允许」：审批弹窗提供“本次会话允许”按钮。点击后当前请求得到允许一次答复，并把对应权限模式记入当前会话；以后同会话的同模式请求会自动答复。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:259-275","lib/client.js:313-334"]}
{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#feature-2","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-allow 的功能「授权管理」：弹窗底部列出当前会话已保存的授权，并提供撤销按钮。撤销后对应授权从 localStorage 删除，后续匹配请求重新显示审批面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:96-111","lib/client.js:342-366"]}
{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#feature-3","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-allow 的功能「审批面板接管」：插件在 conversation.composer slot 注册审批面板，显示请求原因、可关联的 shell 命令，并提供拒绝、允许一次和会话级允许三种操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:203-238","lib/client.js:300-340","lib/client.js:398-405"]}
{"unit_id":"AnakinCao__dsh-session-allow#caveat-1","repo":"AnakinCao/dsh-session-allow","commit":"4722f68c9a2551a8c651c8d43dcac3b5ddbaef5d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-allow 使用浏览器 localStorage 持久化按会话区分的授权键；存储不可用或写入失败时会静默忽略，授权可能只在当前页面生命周期内有效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:69-87"]}
